@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowColor #A54A2E
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam classBorderColor #173A45
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #A54A2E
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam componentBorderColor #173A45
autonumber
actor Customer
actor "Service Staff" as Staff
control "Session / Billing / Payment API" as API
database "Session / payments" as DB
Customer -> API : Request bill using customer cookie
API -> DB : Lock session; set bill_requested_at
note over API,DB : New orders are rejected; reads remain allowed.
Staff -> API : Read bill and confirm payment method
API -> DB : Read opening-price snapshot and counts
API -> API : BillingEngine calculates trusted amount
API -> DB : Save one PAID payment for this session
Staff -> API : Close session in a separate action
API -> DB : Lock; verify matching PAID\nCOMPLETED + table AVAILABLE + revoke grants
note over API,DB : Payment never closes the session automatically.
@enduml
